@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 # CareerQuest AI — High School to College Adventure
+
+Welcome now distinguishes fresh sessions, remembered browser explorers with no selection, and active Adventure Home. Welcome and Switch Explorer share avatar/nickname/explicit-grade/fictional-acknowledgment setup. `POST /api/profiles` now requires `alias`, integer `grade` (9–12), and `fictional_ack: true`; React also sends a UUID `creation_key`, whose durable SQLite receipt prevents duplicate profiles after retries. No setup XP or profile confirmation is awarded. Avatars and explorer associations remain browser-local demo metadata. See the [onboarding diff](docs/test-evidence/onboarding-refinement.diff), [verification results](docs/test-evidence/onboarding-verification.json), and [first-time screenshot](docs/test-evidence/onboarding-first-time-desktop.jpg).
 
 Adventure Home now has portfolio-aware messaging and a brighter four-stage trail. The shared header has one four-item navigation menu; its duplicate progress strip is removed. Current saved portfolios show a completed trail with View My Portfolio, while older snapshots remain distinct and revisitable. See [focused Home/header verification, diff and screenshots](docs/HOME_HEADER_REFINEMENT_VERIFICATION.md).
 
